  "contentHtml": "<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/6e143325-c7c7-37f3-3355-975fc53161bb.png\" width=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>Hey Brew Shop Fam!<br>Here's an update of what's happening this week - from new&nbsp;beer drops, wine reviews, our current tap list, to upcoming tastings, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/eFrkPNvTnwf?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP THIS WEEK’S NEWSLETTER HERE</a>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/gKg7DkIJavD?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP OUR ENTIRE STOCK OF BEER, WINE &amp; HOMEBREW HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/8e099088-00d8-ee8d-8164-5dfa32f3ed8a.png\" width=\"612\" alt=\"Addasubheading_1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>We're excited to bring back </span><strong><span>The Brew Shop 12 Wines of Christmas</span></strong><span> (step aside drummers drumming!). Inside our festive box, you'll find 12 wines to sip through December. Available in </span><strong><span>limited quantities</span></strong><span> and by</span><strong><span> pre-order only</span></strong><span>, make sure you grab your box before they sell out!</span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>Our 12 Wines of Christmas will be hand-selected by your favorite winos (Beth, Julie &amp; Aidan) and filled with never-before-seen-in-the-shop wines perfect to pair with your holidays. What's inside is a surprise, but expect the following -- each box will contain TWO sparklers, THREE whites, SIX reds and ONE wild card. Our holiday elves will wrap each box to keep the surprises coming!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span>12 Wines of Christmas boxes will be available for pick-up beginning Friday, December 4th.</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/Kavg7JrlVOG?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PRE-ORDER 12 WINES OF CHRISTMAS HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/31ff8c7b-3d52-05e0-552b-47e54ddf3f67.jpeg\" width=\"612\" alt=\"Grid45WeeklyTasting_1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>Join us this</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Friday from 5-7 PM</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> as we welcome </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Liz</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> from </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Williams Corner&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>for our free tasting! Scroll down to the bottom of our newsletter to see the full line-up for this month!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/91404982-93cf-fd19-41f6-eb2b5bd126a8.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🧐 Exquisite hops from </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Dancing Gnome</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Fresh Hop Tessellate</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> West Coast IPA with Fresh Hop Mosaic<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Exquisite Beast</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Hazy DIPA with Sultana, Mosaic, Amarillo, Citra &amp; Columbus<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Cabin Color </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Hazy IPA with Simcoe &amp; Mosaic<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Yam Jam</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Hazy IPA with Vic Secret, Galaxy, Mosaic &amp; Citra<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Nectaron Jam </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Single Hop Hazy IPA with Nectaron &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/25f547a2-770b-2b59-a96a-58cecc253667.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🎉 Happy Belated to </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Lost Generation</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>!<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>There Are Always Hops v7</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> American IPA with Riwaka, Motueka &amp; Nectaron<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Feather Kitty</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Hazy IPA with Citra &amp; Mosaic<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Phe Porter</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> with Phe Vietnamese coffee, Tahitian Vanilla &amp; Pandon &nbsp;<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Grave Shift</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Dark Lager</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/070ffbd1-e360-0ffa-67ed-0b7b1cac8951.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🌲 Lose the forest for the beers with </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Commonwealth</span></span></span></span></stro