strong><span><span><span><span>West Coast IPA with Simcoe, Riwaka &amp; Krush<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Neon Green Relish</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> DIPA with Citra &amp; Sabro<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> 2 Deep 2 Fold</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> DIPA with Citra, Tangier, Galaxy &amp; Waimea - collab with </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Other Half</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Trade Paperback Vol.2</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> DIPA with Galaxy, Citra, Motueka, Citra Hyperboost, Motueka Subzero Hop Kief &amp; Motueka Amplifire Fresh Hop Oil<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Triple Unwind Your Mind</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Triple IPA with Mosaic, Motueka &amp; El Dorado</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/a9becca7-3489-7e90-7b38-3c809b7e855d.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🥞 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Divine Barrel</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> always welcome in this town<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Beer Flavored Beer</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Lager<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Japanese Lager</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Stranger in This Town</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Black IPA with Chinook, Sultana, Columbus &amp; Simcoe<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Defensive Pancake</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Porter with Madagascar Vanilla &amp; Vermont Maple Syrup</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/01a2350d-7f54-9f5a-da66-29536e3af6f8.jpg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span> Even more from </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>The Veil</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Imaginary Hug</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Hazy IPA with Mosaic</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Dirt Nap^3</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> TDH Hazy DIPA with Mosaic, Citra, Nelson &amp; Galaxy</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Broz Night Out^3</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Hazy DIPA with Citra</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/8b41b5c7-860f-9216-cd35-5ed8c3fc915e.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f64c/32.png\" alt=\"🙌\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Back in stock…for now!</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Maine Beer Lunch</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> IPA</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/7dcc8b87-e6a0-e391-2f8a-75b840eb6810.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1fad0/32.png\" alt=\"🫐\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span></span></span><span> Berry excited for</span></span><strong><span><span> Blake’s</span></span></strong><span><span><br>• </span></span><strong><span><span>Pomegranate Fizz</span></span></strong><span><span> Cider with Pomegranate &amp; cherry<br>• </span></span><strong><span><span>Nocturna</span></span></strong><span><span> Cider with blackberry, elderberry &amp; vanilla</span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/f134accd-9ef5-fe4f-c851-01d4844f0640.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>☕ Cozy up with </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Stoneface</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Slopeside</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Coffee Milk Stout<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Frostwork</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Hazy IPA with Mosaic, El Dorado, Nectaron Cryo &amp; Kohatu<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>White Elephant</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Winter Ale<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>American Porter</span></span></span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/7e08553f-5e91-cb1c-453f-1f6c7e17b473.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>&nbsp;Got hops?<br>• <strong>Benchtop<span>&nbsp;West Coast Squirrel</span></strong><span> West Coast IPA with Nectaron &amp; Chinook</span><br>• <strong>The Veil<span>&nbsp;Fatty Magoo </span></strong><span>Hazy DIPA with </span>Flop<span> Flop Buns, Galaxy, Mosaic &amp; Mosaic Cryo - collab wit</span>h&nbsp;<strong>Jack Brown's Beer &amp; Burger Joint</strong></p>\n<p>• <strong>Toppling Goliath <span>Lions Dinos &amp; Bears</span></strong><span> West Coast DIPA - collab with</span><strong><span> Firestone Walker</span></strong></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/63ff0241-f5b1-a954-260f-5b0ee6c99b2f.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f342/32.png\" alt=\"🍂\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Anybody need a little fall treat?<br>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> 1911 </span><span>Apple Pie</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Cider</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>New Holland Dragon's Milk Reserve Oatmeal Cookie </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Stout</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1b09e9c5-eb90-c349-a47c-53fe1bc95e6a.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/26c4/32.png\" alt=\"⛄\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span></span></span><span> Stout season with </span></span><strong><span><span>Schlafly</span></span></strong><span><span><br>• </span></span><strong><span><span>Coffee Stout</span></span></strong><span><span><br>• </span></span><strong><span><span>Oatmeal Stout</span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/91c7d9d7-e2aa-c170-ac6c-66cc74a05361.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f44c/32.png\" alt=\"👌\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span>Ace</span></span></strong><span><span> with some A+ ciders<br>• </span></span><strong><span><span>Imperial Raspberry Blueberry</span></span></strong><span><span> Cider<br>• </span></span><strong><span><span>Joker</span></span></strong><span><span> Dry Cider</span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/df0647c8-12e0-d29d-4d0d-bf24a9a59f20.jpg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><strong><span><span><span>Brothers</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> ba</span></span></span></span><span>ck in town</span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Blonde Betty</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Imperial American Blonde Ale with apples</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Pecan Pie</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Brown Ale with vanilla &amp; pecan</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/8fed8c25-bde8-6b3b-a76e-d65008780c51.jpg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span> Cozy up with </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Wyndridge Cider</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Sugar Cookie </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Cider</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Baked Pear</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Cider </span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/caeee74d-e665-bba7-cfc7-032903d364b1.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f64c/32.png\" alt=\"🙌\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> You've got options</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Bingo Acorn Amber</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Ale<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Charles Towne Fermentory Yacht Party </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>American Lager </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Zero Gravity Green State Zero</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> N/A Lager</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/e691f3c9-fa6a-83b0-7e0b-4f1092c5f642.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>Star of the show <strong>Starr Hill</strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Winter Variety Pack</span></span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/67ba43e0-8494-fa53-a854-cbb5dacf9cad.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><strong><span><span>Field Recordings Château Briquette: </span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Andrew Jones is a Brew Shop fan favorite. Aged for 14 months in French oak, Briquette is fun, not-so-serious (but seriously good) Cabernet from Napa with fruit reminiscent of a blackberry pie paired with cocoa, tobacco and a hit of outdoorsy herbs. Andrews nails it again. Sustainable, Native Yeast &amp; Vegan.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>Anne Amie Pinot Noir: </span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Anne Amie Pinot Noir is built for the dinner table and flatters just about anything you serve with it. Juicy and balanced with spiced plum, raspberry, and red cherry. And, if you're a fan of an all female team, Anne Amie is a winner - Kim McLeod leads the winery, Gabi Vignes crafts the wine and Kate Blairstone is the artist behind the gorgeous label. Sustainable &amp; Hand Harvested.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>Lundeen La Cantera Chehalem Mountains Pinot Noir: </span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>The Chehalem Mountains are a small but mighty corner of the Willamette Valley - closest to Portland of the valley’s smaller AVAs and with just over 2% of the acres planted to vine. Michael Lundeen, a fourth generation winemaker in the Willamette Valley, visited the shop where we got to taste the quality and finesse of his small-batch Pinot Noirs first hand. Coming from La Cantera vineyard, enjoy blackberry and strawberry mingling with herbs, forest floor and minerality. Certified Sustainable.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>Molinetto Gavi: </span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>I have a thing for Gavi - the classic northern Italian white made with the Cortese grape. Molinetto Gavi is crisp and dry with heavenly aromas of white flowers and notes of stone fruit and a zing of acidity. Sustainable &amp; Native Yeast.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>Coletti Vino Mi Ti et Mes Amis Arristo Bomba Frizzante: </span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>This effervescent bottle was built for sharing with “me, you, and my friends,” as the name promises. Crisp and fresh with citrus, apple and mineral-undertones. Organic.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>Truchard Carneros Napa Chardonnay: </span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Truchard is a family-owned and operated vineyard in Carneros - the southern part of Napa with cooler temps and marine soil, which make it ideal for gorgeous, balanced Chardonnay. The wine is 100% barrel fermented in French oak, for a full-bodied expression of tropical fruit, rich creaminess and a toasty little swagger.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/b9e8e0c8-c468-8a58-602a-219f573e5b94.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p>As we continue to brave the shorter days and cooler nights, and start preparing for Thanksgiving, Friendsgiving, etc, I'm on the lookout for something shareworthy that I can also have a glass of around the firepit. And while December always leans California Cab in my book, November is perfect for a cozy French red. If you're in our wine club, you're already aware of how much we put our faith in Rhone Varietals this time of year (and don't get me started on Julie's love for Grenache). You wine clubees might also recognize this winemaker from your September pickup, so if you were a big fan, I've got your next fix.<br><br><strong>Bonpas Châteauneuf-du-Pape Bonus Passus</strong>, made primarily from Grenache, with a little Syrah and Mourvèdre, comes from one of France's most famous wine regions, Châteauneuf-du-Pape (CDP). The area became popular in the 1300s when the Pope settled nearby and helped bring attention to the local wines. Today, it's known for producing big, beautiful reds, including this bottle, made from vines averaging 65 years old. Older vines tend to produce fewer grapes, allowing more flavor and concentration to develop, hence the luxury surrounding the CDP region. Expect rich notes of ripe plum, dark cherry, prune, tobacco, and sweet spice, with smooth tannins and a silky finish. Full-bodied and warming, with plenty of elegance.<br><br>And in honor of World Vegan Month, this bottle is vegan-friendly! Some wines actually use animal-derived products like egg whites or gelatin during clarification, so not every wine is vegan by default (fun fact). Bonus Passus skips those ingredients while still delivering all the rich, velvety goodness we love. I think this is a great, sophisticated bottle to bring to Thanksgiving or Friendsgiving, and I would secretly be hoping to bring whatever was left of it home for myself.</p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span>This week’s writeup is brought to you by Aidan</span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/d9fbdb97-b413-ec30-bc34-336ee4155d1b.png\" width=\"612\" alt=\"breathe11x17in_1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p>Thanks for your business! See you soon, Beth, Julie &amp; Aidan and the entire Brew Crew</p>",
